# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: PRP Open RFQ Seller Type Option (non Login) (test case 2134, run 115613, last result SUCCESS)
# Tags: regression
# OFF steps: every step that would send a REAL lead / enquiry / OTP is switched off,
#   plus the checks that only pass after it. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.

open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/CCTV/jdm-1016209-ent-2-13630321?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=cctv&searchLocUpdate=0&stype=category_list&srcterm=CCTV
wait 3 seconds
delete all cookies
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/CCTV/jdm-1016209-ent-2-13630321?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=cctv&searchLocUpdate=0&stype=category_list&srcterm=CCTV
wait 3 seconds
swipe bottom to top
wait 1 seconds
scroll to prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section is visible
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "All"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Wholesalers"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Importers"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Distributors"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Manufacturers"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Exporters"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Dealers"
click prp_open_rfq_seller_type_wholesaler
click prp_open_rfq_seller_type_submit
wait 2 seconds
call SG_PRP_Request_View_Catalogue_Non_Login_to_Login
wait until element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_toast_msg is visible
[ignore] verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_toast_msg is visible
wait 1 seconds
scroll to prp_open_rqq_seller_type_post_login_mobile
store value of prp_open_rqq_seller_type_post_login_mobile as ts_field_value
verify stored ts_field_value equals "${mobile_9987}"
verify element prp_bd5_banner_img is visible
delete all cookies
